<title>JAPAN: Juel Verite - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Juel Verite - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.97		vs	   11.36</p>
<p> Operating	  696    million    vs	  506    million</p>
<p> Current	    694    million    vs	  457    million</p>
<p> Net		  350    million    vs	  202    million</p>
<p> EPS		   22.10 yen	  vs	   14.97 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     18 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Juel Verite Ohkubo Co Ltd is a major retailer of jewellery and luxury watches.</p>
</text>
